[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: GBSK FW Software Failure Modes and Effects Analysis
UID: DHF-GBSK-0024

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this Software Failure Modes and Effects Analysis (SFMEA) is to evaluate the potential failure modes in the GBSK Firmware systems, understand their effects on the system, patient, and other users, prioritize risks, and recommend corrective actions to mitigate those risks. The purpose is to ensure the safety and effectiveness of the device throughout its lifecycle.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The scope of this SFMEA covers the GBSK Firmware systems, derived from their design. This document is to be continuously maintained and updated throughout the lifecycle of the medical device, as potential software failure modes are addressed and mitigated to achieve an acceptable or As Low As Possible level of risk.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

