TITLE: Control Communication Data
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Incorrect Collimator
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. Operator installs collimator
2. Collimator is incorrect one
3. Collimator is defective
4. Firmware detects collimator
5. Emission occurs in an unintended collimator
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
The treatment area of the X-Ray dose will be in an undesired shape.
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Collimator ID is programmed incorrectly
2. Firmware Defect
<<<
