RESIDUAL_P: 1 - Improbable
RESIDUAL_S: 3 - Major
RESIDUAL_RI: 3/ Zone 1 Acceptable
TITLE: Magnetometers
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Magnetometer Reading is incorrect
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. The FW takes a reading of sensor
2. The reading is incorrect
3. The steering magnets are adjusted for with the incorrect data
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
Magnets steer emissions in undesired direction and the patient receives unnecessary X-Ray exposure
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Firmware Defect
<<<
RISK_CONTROLS: >>>
1. There are 2 magnetometers for redundancy
2. Main FW sends a calibration procedure for the magnets
3. Unit test + Code Review
<<<
