[SFMEA]
UID: SFMEA-FW-16
INITIAL_P: 3 - Probable
INITIAL_S: 3 - Major
INITIAL_RI: 9/ Zone 2 ALAP
RESIDUAL_P: 1 - Improbable
RESIDUAL_S: 4 - Critical
RESIDUAL_RI: 4/ Zone 1 Acceptable
TITLE: Emission Limit Output
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Emission current limit signal is not set
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. The FW sets the current limit signal
2. Current limit is not set
3. Emission current can go higher than desired
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
Newly flashed program is unusable or has a hidden bug
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Firmware defect
2. Corrupted data transmission
3. Hardware processing error
<<<
RISK_CONTROLS: >>>
1. Code Solution - Overcurrent fault is thrown if excessive and stopping output
2. Mechanical solution - Emergency Stop switches
3. Unit test + Code Review
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SW-H1FWHVPS-119
  ROLE: Refines

