[SFMEA]
UID: SFMEA-FW-18
INITIAL_P: 3 - Probable
INITIAL_S: 3 - Major
INITIAL_RI: 9/ Zone 2 ALAP
RESIDUAL_P: 1 - Improbable
RESIDUAL_S: 2 - Minor
RESIDUAL_RI: 2/ Zone 1 Acceptable
TITLE: Flash Memory Processing
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Bootloader loads corrupted data to Flash memory
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. The bootloader attempts to program flash with new data
2. Data gets corrupted on transmission or during flash
3. Program is loaded incorrectly
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
Newly flashed program is unusable or has a hidden bug
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Firmware defect
2. Corrupted data transmission
3. Hardware processing error
<<<
RISK_CONTROLS: >>>
1. CRC implemented to check loaded file
2. Flash memory control requires firmware to lock and unlock memory for manipulation
3. Unit Test + Code Review
<<<
