[SFMEA]
UID: SFMEA-FW-20
INITIAL_P: 3 - Probable
INITIAL_S: 4 - Critical
INITIAL_RI: 12/ Zone 2 ALAP
RESIDUAL_P: 1 - Improbable
RESIDUAL_S: 4 - Critical
RESIDUAL_RI: 4/ Zone 1 Acceptable
TITLE: Time Keeping
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Timer does not stop
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. The timer is engaged by the start command
2. The timer counts until the stop time
3. Interrupt does not occur to trigger the stop of the timer
4. Timer continues counting
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
Emission continues without stopping
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Firmware Defect
<<<
RISK_CONTROLS: >>>
1. Mechanism - Dedicated 32.768kHz crystal
2. Mechanism - 2nd timer in case one fails
3. Code solution - Interrupt based
4. Unit test + Code Review
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SW-H1FWT-29
  ROLE: Refines

