RESIDUAL_P: 1 - Improbable
RESIDUAL_S: 4 - Critical
RESIDUAL_RI: 4/ Zone 1 Acceptable
TITLE: Communication Protocol
FAILURE_MODE: >>>
Timer does not communicate correctly
<<<
FORESEEABLE_SEQUENCE_OF_EVENTS: >>>
1. Main Control App FW sends a command to the Timer FW
2. The Timer FW does not respond accurately
3. The Main Control App FW does not have accurate timer behavior
<<<
EFFECT: >>>
X-Ray emission can continue without a pause command.
<<<
CAUSES: >>>
1. Firmware Defect
<<<
RISK_CONTROLS: >>>
1. Code solution - CRC is implemented for data packets
2. Mechanism - Emergency Stops can stop emission
3. Unit test + Code Review
<<<
